# Copy then Tab, Shift+Tab, zoom out, folding, grouping and paste do nothing on an Upcoming entry; only the final x changes the file.
file <<END
Work:
	- Plan @due({today+2})
		- Step
	- Ship @due({today+3})
END
keys gU j
see ▌ - Ship  Work
keys y <Tab> <S-Tab> , ' p P
keys k x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Plan @due({today+2}) @done({today})
		- Step
	- Ship @due({today+3})
END
